       DATA DIVISION.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           *> PS-NOTIFY: tells the operator there is nothing new, with a snackbar.
           *> Uses:   WS-LANG-IX and PS-TEXT row 20 ("No new notifications" in English) of that
           *>         column.
           *> Result: Snb-Note::Text = PS-TEXT(20, WS-LANG-IX), trimmed; Snb-Note::Show() raises the
           *>         notification. No data item changes.

           CALL    "PS-NOTIFY"
]]></Event>
  </Control>
