    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-NEXT--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           *> PS-SONG-NEXT: goes to the next song and shows it.
           *> Uses:   WS-SONG (1 to 3; 1 at load); PS-SONG-SHOW also reads the WS-SONG-TABLE rows.
           *> Result: WS-SONG = WS-SONG + 1, or 1 when it was 3. PS-SONG-SHOW then sets
           *>         Lbl-Song::Caption to the title and Lbl-Album-Name::Caption to the album of
           *>         that song.

           CALL    "PS-SONG-NEXT"
]]></Event>
  </Control>
